{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46208","headline":"山居诗二十四首 二十二 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自古浮华能几几，逝波终日去滔滔。\n汉王废苑生秋草，吴主荒宫入夜涛。\n满屋黄金机不息，一头白发气犹高。\n岂知知足金仙子，霞外天香满毳袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}